  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Arrange the following in increasing order of reactivity towards nitration</p><p>A. <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></math>-xylene</p><p>B. bromobenzene</p><p>C. mesitylene</p><p>D.&nbsp;nitrobenzene</p><p>E. benzene</p><p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below</p>"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Nitration is an electrophilic aromatic substitution reaction. The <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></math>&nbsp;effect increases the rate of nitration whereas the <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></math>&nbsp;effect decreases the rate of nitration.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>NO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>Br</mi><mo>(</mo><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>but</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>dominant</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>and</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0076_03806b76fe3f.png\" style=\"width: 456px; height: 150px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>NO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> is strongly deactivating</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mi>Br</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo></math> deactivating</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo></math> activating group</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math></p></blockquote>"
  }
